WEBVTT

00:30.876 --> 00:34.426
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.446 --> 00:37.826
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.096 --> 00:44.066
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.226 --> 00:48.856
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.876 --> 00:52.386
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.406 --> 00:55.896
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.916 --> 00:59.426
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.446 --> 01:05.506
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.766 --> 01:23.046
Si Jin

01:23.066 --> 01:27.046
Episode 10

01:27.046 --> 01:30.806
(Capital Security Office)

01:55.426 --> 01:56.676
Qian still has me.

01:56.676 --> 01:58.496
I can look after her.

01:58.516 --> 01:59.716
Unlike Si

01:59.716 --> 02:01.436
who's motherless.

02:02.866 --> 02:04.316
Motherless?

02:04.586 --> 02:07.466
Yes. Her mother died when she was born.

02:07.466 --> 02:09.626
They call her a jinx.

02:21.346 --> 02:22.656
Mrs. Zhen,

02:22.676 --> 02:24.036
please.

02:32.276 --> 02:33.636
Heng.

02:39.276 --> 02:40.506
Good morning, Mother.

02:40.526 --> 02:42.166
How did you sleep last night?

02:42.486 --> 02:43.906
Thanks for your concern, Mother.

02:43.926 --> 02:45.486
I had a good night's sleep.

02:49.246 --> 02:50.646
Very well.

02:51.886 --> 02:55.126
Where's Commandant Yu?

02:57.246 --> 02:59.686
He didn't come to the office.

03:00.086 --> 03:01.806
I think he's working on a case.

03:04.486 --> 03:06.686
He and Miss Jiang Si

03:06.686 --> 03:08.486
seem to be close.

03:10.926 --> 03:13.206
He once saved her brother,

03:13.486 --> 03:15.366
Jiang Zhan, on the Grill Ground.

03:16.646 --> 03:18.086
Brother!

03:22.366 --> 03:23.726
Who was it?

03:26.406 --> 03:28.126
He's the savior of her family,

03:28.806 --> 03:30.366
but others might think

03:30.366 --> 03:31.806
they're a...

03:32.926 --> 03:34.286
a couple.

03:42.206 --> 03:44.086
Even if they really are,

03:44.366 --> 03:46.006
I believe she won't

03:46.406 --> 03:48.206
cross the line.

03:48.926 --> 03:50.666
I wouldn't say the same

03:50.686 --> 03:52.646
about Commandant Yu.

03:56.126 --> 03:57.426
Heng,

03:57.446 --> 03:59.146
I brought you chicken soup.

03:59.166 --> 04:00.576
Take it while it's hot.

04:00.726 --> 04:02.086
Thanks, Mother.

04:08.686 --> 04:09.786
Mother,

04:09.806 --> 04:12.046
it's so flavorful.

04:13.366 --> 04:14.906
If you like it,

04:14.926 --> 04:17.046
I'll make you soup every day.

04:24.806 --> 04:26.586
Haitang Chamber remains the same.

04:26.606 --> 04:28.166
I miss it so much.

04:29.486 --> 04:30.846
Have a seat, Yi.

04:34.686 --> 04:36.866
How has Zhan been lately?

04:36.886 --> 04:38.886
Did he stir up trouble and get beaten?

04:39.246 --> 04:40.466
The same as usual.

04:40.486 --> 04:41.846
He's fine.

04:42.046 --> 04:42.886
Have some water.

04:42.886 --> 04:44.466
I can't stop worrying about him.

04:44.486 --> 04:46.686
Si, I can't come home too often.

04:46.686 --> 04:48.066
Only you can discipline him.

04:48.086 --> 04:48.926
Rest assured.

04:48.926 --> 04:50.726
I'll keep an eye on him.

04:51.006 --> 04:52.146
I'm worried about you.

04:52.166 --> 04:53.806
You can only come back

04:53.806 --> 04:54.986
for the festivals.

04:55.006 --> 04:55.886
We don't know

04:55.886 --> 04:57.426
if you're well.

04:57.446 --> 04:59.126
Father misses you dearly.

04:59.146 --> 05:00.046
I'm good.

05:00.046 --> 05:01.306
Don't worry about me.

05:01.326 --> 05:03.286
Is your mother-in-law kind?

05:03.366 --> 05:06.406
Do you and your husband fight?

05:06.606 --> 05:08.166
Why ask?

05:08.566 --> 05:10.226
I'm simply curious.

05:10.246 --> 05:11.446
When they meant to marry me

05:11.446 --> 05:12.966
into Duke An's Mansion,

05:13.106 --> 05:14.906
I kept wondering

05:14.926 --> 05:16.766
what it was like

05:16.766 --> 05:18.226
to live with strangers

05:18.246 --> 05:19.646
in a strange house.

05:20.486 --> 05:21.986
Now that I'm single again,

05:22.006 --> 05:23.226
and I won't

05:23.246 --> 05:24.966
marry someone else soon,

05:25.246 --> 05:26.846
I'm relieved.

05:28.246 --> 05:30.426
It's normal to have such concerns,

05:30.446 --> 05:32.366
but you need to learn to be tolerant

05:32.366 --> 05:34.406
to get along well with others.

05:36.366 --> 05:38.226
My husband and I respect each other.

05:38.246 --> 05:39.906
We've never had a fight.

05:39.926 --> 05:41.726
He always protects me.

05:43.006 --> 05:45.846
My daughter, Yan, is sweet.

05:46.446 --> 05:48.226
As strict as my mother-in-law is,

05:48.246 --> 05:50.086
she isn't mean to me.

05:50.126 --> 05:52.306
I'm content with my life.

05:52.326 --> 05:53.726
Protecting you?

05:54.166 --> 05:55.246
What's wrong?

05:55.246 --> 05:57.526
What's your husband protecting you from?

06:01.166 --> 06:02.426
His mother

06:02.446 --> 06:04.486
still wants a grandson.

06:04.806 --> 06:06.046
Ever since we got married,

06:06.046 --> 06:07.666
I haven't given birth to a son.

06:07.686 --> 06:09.606
She's unhappy about it, of course.

06:10.046 --> 06:11.486
If I didn't ask,

06:11.566 --> 06:12.566
you'd never

06:12.566 --> 06:14.166
tell me anything.

06:15.246 --> 06:17.106
No one's life is perfect.

06:17.126 --> 06:19.676
Telling you that would only make you upset.

06:19.696 --> 06:20.566
I'd be upset

06:20.566 --> 06:22.086
if you hid it from me.

06:22.246 --> 06:23.966
I feel we're estranged.

06:25.366 --> 06:27.366
Are you threatening me, silly?

06:27.606 --> 06:28.786
Long time no see.

06:28.806 --> 06:30.726
You've somewhat changed.

06:31.006 --> 06:31.906
Yi,

06:31.926 --> 06:33.746
what else troubles you at their house?

06:33.766 --> 06:35.286
Tell me everything.

06:36.606 --> 06:38.246
Other girls wouldn't be so keen

06:38.246 --> 06:40.106
on hearing their sisters' troubles.

06:40.126 --> 06:41.466
There's none.

06:41.486 --> 06:42.906
All is well.

06:42.926 --> 06:44.486
All is well?

06:44.606 --> 06:45.966
Really?

06:47.006 --> 06:48.606
Look, if anything

06:48.606 --> 06:50.346
upsets you in the future,

06:50.366 --> 06:51.566
let me know

06:51.566 --> 06:52.806
immediately,

06:52.806 --> 06:54.026
alright?

06:54.046 --> 06:54.986
Si,

06:55.006 --> 06:57.406
what makes you say that?

06:57.766 --> 06:59.966
Promise me that.

07:02.246 --> 07:04.606
Fine. I promise.

07:14.486 --> 07:15.586
Chief,

07:15.606 --> 07:17.146
we've been staking out for a while.

07:17.166 --> 07:19.726
The Surreal Wander seller hasn't shown up.

07:19.766 --> 07:21.126
Did we somehow alert him?

07:21.126 --> 07:23.466
(Black Market)
Didn't you check him out?

07:23.486 --> 07:25.666
No one knows who he is.

07:25.686 --> 07:27.106
He's a lone wolf

07:27.126 --> 07:28.566
who comes and goes like a shadow.

07:28.566 --> 07:29.926
It's not easy

07:29.926 --> 07:31.526
to catch him.

07:34.606 --> 07:36.606
Chief, there he is.

07:38.246 --> 07:39.846
That braided man.

07:50.246 --> 07:52.726
(200 Taels)

07:52.726 --> 07:55.366
(20 Taels)

07:55.366 --> 07:56.806
(10 Taels)

07:59.246 --> 08:01.166
It's good. I'll take 100 grams.

08:09.046 --> 08:10.326
Go and follow him.

08:10.326 --> 08:11.686
Yes.

08:57.606 --> 08:59.246
Chief, the buyer went straight home.

08:59.246 --> 09:00.366
I found nothing suspicious.

09:00.366 --> 09:01.746
Go and get prepared.

09:01.766 --> 09:03.706
Catch that scorpion breeder next time.

09:03.726 --> 09:05.086
Yes.

09:08.126 --> 09:09.346
Aunt Xiao,

09:09.366 --> 09:10.246
you've been managing

09:10.246 --> 09:11.466
our house for decades.

09:11.486 --> 09:13.446
It's time for you to rest.

09:14.006 --> 09:15.506
I've been handling everything

09:15.526 --> 09:16.366
in this mansion

09:16.366 --> 09:17.706
all these years.

09:17.726 --> 09:19.966
You can't take that away from me.

09:20.126 --> 09:21.866
In terms of buying people over

09:21.886 --> 09:23.586
to do dirty deeds,

09:23.606 --> 09:25.566
I'm certainly not your match.

09:27.086 --> 09:28.526
Later, I'll explain everything

09:28.526 --> 09:29.486
to your grandmother.

09:29.486 --> 09:31.486
Aunt Xiao, you probably don't know

09:31.606 --> 09:33.486
that you'll have to rest in your room

09:33.486 --> 09:35.106
for a few days

09:35.126 --> 09:36.746
because Grandmother has

09:36.766 --> 09:38.686
had you grounded.

09:47.606 --> 09:49.626
That stupid Jiang Pei

09:49.646 --> 09:51.086
must've sold me out.

09:51.886 --> 09:52.826
Ms. Xiao,

09:52.846 --> 09:54.186
Lady Jiang asked us

09:54.206 --> 09:55.966
to escort you back.

09:57.246 --> 09:58.346
I can walk.

09:58.366 --> 09:59.726
I don't need you.

10:02.006 --> 10:03.566
Watch your step, My Lady.

10:08.406 --> 10:09.506
Good morning, My Lady.

10:09.526 --> 10:12.846
My tiddlers need to eat.

10:15.406 --> 10:16.726
Eat now!

10:16.726 --> 10:18.886
There they are to eat.

10:18.886 --> 10:21.226
You only come to me for food.

10:21.246 --> 10:22.846
Eat up!

10:23.006 --> 10:24.366
Grandmother.

10:33.006 --> 10:34.506
Good morning, Grandmother.

10:34.526 --> 10:36.366
Did you sleep well last night?

10:37.406 --> 10:38.966
I was troubled

10:38.966 --> 10:40.986
by all those things at home.

10:41.006 --> 10:41.966
How could I

10:41.966 --> 10:43.966
sleep well?

10:45.646 --> 10:47.806
I'm sorry for troubling you

10:48.206 --> 10:49.986
with my divorce.

10:50.006 --> 10:52.186
Did you forget what I said?

10:52.206 --> 10:54.466
Now that you're back,

10:54.486 --> 10:56.706
no need to come to greet me every day.

10:56.726 --> 10:58.506
Stay in your courtyard

10:58.526 --> 11:00.366
and rest.

11:04.726 --> 11:07.106
Why did you come so early?

11:07.126 --> 11:08.636
Is there something wrong?

11:10.246 --> 11:12.246
Nothing can get past you, Grandmother.

11:14.086 --> 11:15.466
Is this for your mother?

11:15.486 --> 11:16.606
Over the years, she's been

11:16.606 --> 11:17.826
managing the household

11:17.846 --> 11:19.646
and keeping everything in order.

11:19.646 --> 11:21.386
She's hardly done anything wrong.

11:21.406 --> 11:22.406
Isn't it a bit unfair

11:22.406 --> 11:24.366
to bring her down simply because

11:24.526 --> 11:26.326
she lost her head for the moment?

11:28.486 --> 11:30.106
Sometimes,

11:30.126 --> 11:32.006
when people are in charge for too long,

11:32.006 --> 11:34.346
they'll have the wrong idea

11:34.366 --> 11:36.706
that they own such power

11:36.726 --> 11:38.486
and can do as they want

11:38.486 --> 11:40.226
for their selfish gains.

11:40.246 --> 11:42.106
Mother is nothing like that.

11:42.126 --> 11:43.526
She always puts our clan first.

11:43.526 --> 11:45.326
She'd never be so selfish.

11:46.006 --> 11:48.466
You're so naive, Qian.

11:48.486 --> 11:50.526
You've been through so much.

11:50.526 --> 11:52.206
How come you still can't

11:52.206 --> 11:54.726
see through others?

11:56.726 --> 11:59.206
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

12:07.246 --> 12:08.606
Yi,

12:09.766 --> 12:11.586
take good care of yourself.

12:11.606 --> 12:13.966
Come back with Yan whenever you can.

12:14.486 --> 12:15.826
I will.

12:15.846 --> 12:17.086
Take care of yourselves

12:17.086 --> 12:18.606
and Father, too.

12:19.366 --> 12:20.966
Si, if you miss me,

12:20.966 --> 12:22.746
come to my place in Lingshui.

12:22.766 --> 12:25.066
I'll visit you later.

12:25.086 --> 12:26.346
I miss Yan a lot.

12:26.366 --> 12:27.846
She misses you, too.

12:31.886 --> 12:33.586
Managing the house isn't easy.

12:33.606 --> 12:35.086
Be very careful.

12:35.086 --> 12:36.606
Don't get hurt.

12:37.766 --> 12:40.006
Zhan, take care of Si.

12:40.006 --> 12:41.566
I will, Yi.

12:41.606 --> 12:43.486
Zhan, Si,

12:43.606 --> 12:44.966
take care.

12:45.246 --> 12:46.606
Ziyu,

12:47.766 --> 12:49.846
please look after my sister.

13:00.886 --> 13:02.246
Take care.

13:06.366 --> 13:07.726
Ziyu,

13:07.886 --> 13:09.446
have a safe trip.

13:09.726 --> 13:11.486
Do take care of Yi.

13:56.766 --> 13:58.246
Why did Si

13:58.366 --> 14:00.466
go missing all of a sudden?

14:00.486 --> 14:01.606
Why did I stop Mr. Zhen

14:01.606 --> 14:03.266
from investigating it?

14:03.286 --> 14:05.206
Have you thought about that?

14:05.246 --> 14:07.526
Don't be swayed by emotions.

14:07.526 --> 14:09.086
Otherwise,

14:09.606 --> 14:12.346
you'll be blinded.

14:12.366 --> 14:14.106
Do you know

14:14.126 --> 14:15.726
what means the most

14:15.726 --> 14:17.126
to your mother?

14:19.006 --> 14:21.086
- It's...
- It's not our clan

14:21.246 --> 14:23.726
but the status of your branch.

14:25.206 --> 14:27.186
She'd do anything

14:27.206 --> 14:29.686
for it.

14:37.606 --> 14:38.626
Do you

14:38.646 --> 14:40.726
trust Si that much?

14:42.086 --> 14:43.186
I entrusted her

14:43.206 --> 14:45.006
with such a huge responsibility

14:45.006 --> 14:46.966
to help manage the household

14:46.966 --> 14:50.326
and keep her from danger. Wasn't that good?

14:51.486 --> 14:53.126
Some people don't know

14:53.126 --> 14:54.126
what's the most important

14:54.126 --> 14:56.186
throughout their lives

14:56.206 --> 14:58.346
but act on impulse.

14:58.366 --> 15:01.726
That won't get them too far.

15:06.006 --> 15:07.366
Qian,

15:08.006 --> 15:09.346
I know

15:09.366 --> 15:11.086
you're hurt.

15:11.126 --> 15:12.506
You're in great pain.

15:12.526 --> 15:13.606
But you cannot

15:13.606 --> 15:15.446
give yourself up

15:15.526 --> 15:17.606
for one failed marriage.

15:18.606 --> 15:21.326
If we make the right move,

15:21.726 --> 15:24.246
your life will pick up for sure.

15:27.886 --> 15:29.606
Then

15:30.246 --> 15:32.886
you'll still be the best girl in our mansion.

15:33.846 --> 15:36.216
Your grandmother will be proud
of you the most.

15:37.486 --> 15:39.606
So far, I've taken every step

15:39.646 --> 15:41.846
as Mother's planned.

15:43.966 --> 15:46.206
But what exactly do I want

15:47.606 --> 15:49.006
the most?

15:54.406 --> 15:56.886
Does Miss Si want to manage the household?

15:56.886 --> 15:58.006
Without Ms. Xiao,

15:58.006 --> 15:59.206
who can she manage?

15:59.206 --> 16:00.886
Herself, I guess.

16:03.126 --> 16:04.586
I'm having a stiff neck.

16:04.606 --> 16:05.866
I slept on the wrong side.

16:05.886 --> 16:07.106
Are you alright?

16:07.126 --> 16:08.246
It's terrible.

16:08.246 --> 16:09.886
You've hardly done anything.

16:09.886 --> 16:11.226
You may rest today.

16:11.246 --> 16:12.846
- I didn't do anything.
- Eat.

16:12.846 --> 16:13.966
Nourish your body.

16:13.966 --> 16:14.806
It hurts.

16:14.816 --> 16:16.236
I know.

16:16.606 --> 16:18.206
I'm mad.

16:20.206 --> 16:21.246
Stop wearing a long face.

16:21.246 --> 16:22.726
You lazybones!

16:22.766 --> 16:24.486
It's already late,

16:24.486 --> 16:26.006
but you haven't started cooking.

16:26.006 --> 16:27.266
Do you want to quit?

16:27.286 --> 16:29.086
There she is, picking up a fight.

16:31.766 --> 16:33.126
I know

16:33.406 --> 16:35.006
you think Miss Si is too young

16:35.006 --> 16:36.226
to run the house.

16:36.246 --> 16:38.066
But she said

16:38.086 --> 16:39.846
you'd better not

16:39.846 --> 16:41.106
dig your own grave.

16:41.126 --> 16:42.626
If you can't do your job,

16:42.646 --> 16:43.846
when Lady Jiang asks,

16:43.846 --> 16:45.566
none of you will be spared!

16:48.126 --> 16:49.986
How dare that stupid little girl

16:50.006 --> 16:51.086
barge in here

16:51.086 --> 16:52.226
and tell us what to do!

16:52.246 --> 16:53.466
Look,

16:53.486 --> 16:55.506
she isn't all wrong.

16:55.526 --> 16:57.166
We've been working here for so long.

16:57.166 --> 16:58.906
Don't we know Lady Jiang

16:58.926 --> 17:00.086
better than her?

17:00.086 --> 17:01.446
Yes.

17:02.286 --> 17:04.666
I meant to take revenge for Ms. Xiao.

17:04.686 --> 17:05.966
Take revenge?

17:05.966 --> 17:07.526
There are many other ways.

17:07.526 --> 17:09.566
(Morning Drizzle)

17:09.566 --> 17:12.006
(Haitang Chamber)

17:12.006 --> 17:12.946
Miss,

17:12.966 --> 17:15.066
you've been working from dusk to dawn.

17:15.086 --> 17:16.086
Why did you

17:16.086 --> 17:17.906
bear such a heavy responsibility?

17:18.686 --> 17:19.786
Let me ask you this.

17:19.806 --> 17:21.326
Would anyone in the house

17:21.326 --> 17:23.326
dare to harm Aunt Xiao?

17:23.486 --> 17:24.846
No.

17:25.046 --> 17:26.566
Jiang Pei drugged me

17:26.566 --> 17:27.766
on Grandmother's birthday.

17:27.766 --> 17:29.066
Who told her to do so?

17:29.086 --> 17:30.146
Who...?

17:30.166 --> 17:31.526
Ms. Xiao, of course.

17:31.766 --> 17:33.506
Looks like I've trained you well.

17:33.526 --> 17:34.646
If you're in charge,

17:34.646 --> 17:35.806
no one can harm you

17:35.806 --> 17:36.846
or our branch again.

17:36.846 --> 17:38.206
Exactly.

17:39.926 --> 17:41.286
Miss,

17:41.766 --> 17:44.126
do you like Mr. Zhen?

17:45.766 --> 17:47.566
Why ask?

17:47.806 --> 17:48.686
Clearly,

17:48.686 --> 17:49.966
he likes you.

17:49.966 --> 17:52.246
I've seen it clearly.

17:53.966 --> 17:55.686
He's a good man.

17:55.726 --> 17:57.826
He's brave and upright

17:57.846 --> 17:58.766
compared with officials

17:58.766 --> 18:00.846
who use every means to fawn on others.

18:01.246 --> 18:02.886
I admire people like him,

18:03.286 --> 18:04.766
but

18:05.566 --> 18:07.366
that's all.

18:08.526 --> 18:09.646
I also think

18:09.646 --> 18:10.806
you'd better

18:10.806 --> 18:12.326
not fall for him.

18:14.166 --> 18:15.386
Why is that?

18:15.406 --> 18:17.606
Commandant Yu is much better.

18:17.726 --> 18:19.446
Whenever you were in trouble,

18:19.446 --> 18:21.306
he always came in time and helped you out.

18:21.326 --> 18:23.566
Hadn't you told me about it,

18:23.566 --> 18:25.846
no one wouldn't have known.

18:26.086 --> 18:28.046
Miss, isn't he like

18:28.046 --> 18:30.266
those heroes in stories who help others

18:30.286 --> 18:32.606
without leaving their names?

18:32.726 --> 18:34.786
We can't always rely on others' help.

18:34.806 --> 18:36.226
Stop reading those stories.

18:36.246 --> 18:37.686
They aren't true.

18:37.926 --> 18:39.806
But Commandant Yu is real.

18:41.246 --> 18:42.466
Miss,

18:42.486 --> 18:45.846
do you have feelings for him?

18:47.966 --> 18:48.906
No!

18:48.926 --> 18:50.426
I don't have feelings for anyone.

18:50.446 --> 18:51.446
My priority is to manage

18:51.446 --> 18:52.746
the house and our business.

18:52.766 --> 18:55.086
That's enough. Stop asking questions.

18:55.246 --> 18:56.206
Or I won't be able to

18:56.206 --> 18:57.926
finish the accounts.

18:58.046 --> 18:59.806
Enjoy your sweet soup.

19:00.446 --> 19:01.746
Fine. Alright.

19:01.766 --> 19:03.246
I'm leaving.

19:04.036 --> 19:08.976
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

19:09.346 --> 19:11.726
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

19:11.726 --> 19:15.436
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

19:15.436 --> 19:19.066
(Monthly Balance: 7...)

19:19.086 --> 19:22.746
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

19:22.766 --> 19:26.186
♪ Growing between us ♪

19:26.336 --> 19:31.856
♪ And breeding love ♪

19:31.966 --> 19:33.446
I've figured out a plan

19:33.446 --> 19:34.806
to end it for good.

19:35.006 --> 19:36.336
What is it?

19:36.356 --> 19:38.956
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

19:38.966 --> 19:40.326
Marry me.

19:40.676 --> 19:42.336
♪ Like shadows ♪

19:42.346 --> 19:43.196
(When)

19:43.196 --> 19:44.986
(will those words he said)

19:45.006 --> 19:47.286
(stop making my heart flutter?)

19:48.326 --> 19:50.766
(Yu Qi hasn't shown up lately.)

19:50.926 --> 19:52.226
(Perhaps he's stopped)

19:52.246 --> 19:54.446
(digging into my identity as the Saintess.)

19:55.486 --> 19:56.826
(That's good.)

19:56.846 --> 19:58.926
(I can finally live in peace.)

20:01.316 --> 20:05.906
♪ And stars ♪

20:05.926 --> 20:07.566
Someone fell into the water!

20:10.346 --> 20:12.876
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

20:12.896 --> 20:16.516
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

20:16.536 --> 20:19.966
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

20:19.986 --> 20:24.486
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

20:24.506 --> 20:28.196
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

20:28.196 --> 20:32.496
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

20:32.516 --> 20:34.666
♪ Like shadows ♪

20:34.686 --> 20:36.086
She has a totem on her,

20:36.086 --> 20:37.166
and she drew the scenery

20:37.166 --> 20:38.266
of the South.

20:38.286 --> 20:40.286
Why halt the investigation?

20:42.586 --> 20:46.736
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

20:46.816 --> 20:48.646
♪ Time glows ♪

20:48.646 --> 20:52.066
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

20:52.086 --> 20:53.096
You're awake.

20:53.116 --> 20:56.706
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

20:56.726 --> 20:59.126
Thanks for caring for me.

20:59.846 --> 21:03.046
You were injured because of me.

21:03.206 --> 21:05.366
If I couldn't at least look after you,

21:05.766 --> 21:07.886
I'd live with a guilty conscience.

21:08.486 --> 21:11.126
It's nothing but a scratch.

21:11.526 --> 21:13.446
I'm used to it.

21:14.646 --> 21:16.046
Don't worry.

21:16.046 --> 21:17.946
It's much worse than a scratch.

21:17.966 --> 21:19.786
The physician just said

21:19.806 --> 21:21.306
any later

21:21.326 --> 21:22.426
and we might have to

21:22.446 --> 21:24.046
burn incense to honor you.

21:44.526 --> 21:45.466
Master, are you alright?

21:45.466 --> 21:47.456
- Master.
- What did the servants do?

21:48.406 --> 21:50.186
Is there anyone to manage this house?

21:50.206 --> 21:51.286
What a bad start to the day.

21:51.286 --> 21:53.686
Terrible! How terrible!

21:57.326 --> 21:58.686
Help me get changed.

21:59.086 --> 22:06.606
(Virtues Run Far)

22:24.286 --> 22:26.526
Grandmother, Father,

22:26.566 --> 22:28.386
Qian, Ms. Ruan,

22:28.406 --> 22:30.046
please be seated and eat.

22:30.406 --> 22:31.746
Mind the step, My Lady.

22:31.766 --> 22:33.466
Yes, sure.

22:33.486 --> 22:35.546
Be careful, Grandmother.

22:35.566 --> 22:36.926
Careful.

22:37.966 --> 22:40.086
Thanks, Qian.

22:40.846 --> 22:42.166
Where's Uncle Anmou?

22:42.166 --> 22:44.246
Here I come!

22:46.486 --> 22:49.246
What happened to you, Anmou?

22:49.846 --> 22:52.226
The ground was wet.

22:52.246 --> 22:53.606
I slipped and fell.

22:53.966 --> 22:55.226
Are you alright?

22:55.246 --> 22:56.606
I'm fine.

22:58.246 --> 23:00.126
I'll check it later.

23:01.846 --> 23:03.406
You should.

23:09.006 --> 23:10.446
It's been a while since we had

23:10.446 --> 23:12.606
such plain food for breakfast.

23:13.086 --> 23:14.966
When I meditated in the mountain,

23:14.966 --> 23:16.266
I also

23:16.286 --> 23:18.706
had these in the morning.

23:18.726 --> 23:20.066
A light diet

23:20.086 --> 23:21.986
in the morning is healthy.

23:22.006 --> 23:22.986
Right.

23:23.006 --> 23:25.246
Mother, let's eat.

23:39.966 --> 23:41.806
Has the congee gone bad?

23:44.966 --> 23:46.846
It smells a bit off.

23:50.486 --> 23:52.026
The bun seems...

23:52.046 --> 23:53.606
Nothing has

23:53.686 --> 23:55.786
gone well since this morning.

23:55.806 --> 23:56.946
Mother,

23:56.966 --> 23:58.766
Si is still too young

23:58.766 --> 24:00.786
to manage such a big house.

24:00.806 --> 24:02.426
If you let her do it,

24:02.446 --> 24:03.386
who knows

24:03.406 --> 24:04.246
how much trouble

24:04.246 --> 24:05.766
she'll cause?

24:07.646 --> 24:11.366
Chaos will arise. Our clan will fall.

24:11.446 --> 24:12.806
Anmou,

24:13.646 --> 24:16.006
will some spoiled food

24:16.406 --> 24:18.766
lead to chaos?

24:19.006 --> 24:20.546
Have you been

24:20.566 --> 24:23.226
an official for so long

24:23.246 --> 24:24.686
that you've started labeling people

24:24.686 --> 24:26.326
at home at will, too?

24:31.006 --> 24:32.226
Brother,

24:32.246 --> 24:33.986
you've become

24:34.006 --> 24:35.286
much more sarcastic.

24:35.286 --> 24:36.486
Who started it?

24:36.486 --> 24:37.766
The congee has gone sour!

24:37.766 --> 24:38.766
So what?

24:38.766 --> 24:40.126
Enough!

24:40.926 --> 24:43.446
You, sit down.

24:48.846 --> 24:50.846
What a bummer.

24:54.246 --> 24:56.846
Both of you are fathers.

24:57.166 --> 24:59.006
It's embarrassing

24:59.006 --> 25:01.006
to argue before your children.

25:03.846 --> 25:05.246
Si,

25:05.846 --> 25:08.086
you've been in charge lately.

25:08.206 --> 25:10.166
Can you handle the work?

25:10.246 --> 25:12.746
Grandmother, Uncle Anmou,

25:12.766 --> 25:14.666
things that happened today

25:14.686 --> 25:16.886
won't happen again. I promise.

25:16.926 --> 25:18.526
Please give me three more days.

25:18.526 --> 25:20.386
If I fail to run the household,

25:20.406 --> 25:22.566
I'll return the tokens and the keys.

25:23.006 --> 25:24.566
Three more days?

25:25.006 --> 25:27.646
You can barely go through today.

25:31.006 --> 25:32.366
I won't eat it.

25:33.486 --> 25:35.086
Suit yourself.

25:41.006 --> 25:42.546
You've been making shoe soles for days.

25:42.566 --> 25:43.746
Are they not done yet?

25:43.766 --> 25:45.246
Yes. I get tired just looking at them.

25:45.246 --> 25:46.246
Have some walnuts.

25:46.246 --> 25:48.226
Are you busy, ladies?

25:48.246 --> 25:49.666
Miss Si.

25:49.686 --> 25:51.766
Wake up! Miss Si is here!

25:51.806 --> 25:53.606
Miss... Miss Si.

25:54.326 --> 25:56.386
You must be tired.

25:56.406 --> 25:57.406
I can manage.

25:57.406 --> 25:59.006
I'm not young anymore.

25:59.006 --> 26:00.166
I was napping

26:00.166 --> 26:01.786
when you came in.

26:01.806 --> 26:03.426
It was my fault to disturb you

26:03.446 --> 26:05.166
when you were sleeping.

26:05.446 --> 26:06.306
Well,

26:06.326 --> 26:07.926
clearly, you're exhausted.

26:07.926 --> 26:09.546
You may take today off

26:09.566 --> 26:10.486
and rest.

26:10.486 --> 26:12.846
The kitchen no longer needs you.

26:15.006 --> 26:15.846
Miss Si,

26:15.846 --> 26:17.226
what's that supposed to mean?

26:17.246 --> 26:18.746
Are you kicking us out?

26:18.766 --> 26:20.526
We're senior servants in this house.

26:20.526 --> 26:22.626
We've been working here our entire life.

26:22.646 --> 26:24.206
Yes, Miss Si.

26:24.206 --> 26:25.966
None of the prominent clans in town

26:25.966 --> 26:28.086
would drive out their senior servants.

26:28.526 --> 26:30.226
Don't mistake it.

26:30.246 --> 26:32.406
I care about senior servants like you.

26:32.406 --> 26:34.066
That's why I'm giving you a few days off.

26:34.086 --> 26:35.766
Working in the kitchen all day

26:35.766 --> 26:37.226
is exhausting.

26:37.246 --> 26:38.326
Enjoy your vacation.

26:38.326 --> 26:40.566
You'll still be paid the same.

26:40.566 --> 26:41.926
Take as much time off as you want.

26:41.926 --> 26:43.886
You may come back later.

26:44.286 --> 26:45.386
Really?

26:45.406 --> 26:46.526
Do you mean it?

26:46.526 --> 26:48.166
Of course.

26:48.766 --> 26:49.766
I hired these two chefs

26:49.766 --> 26:51.946
from the Guangju Restaurant.

26:51.966 --> 26:54.306
We can try some new dishes for a change.

26:54.326 --> 26:56.846
Relax. Don't worry about your work.

26:58.286 --> 26:59.266
Aman,

26:59.286 --> 27:00.766
show them around the kitchen.

27:00.766 --> 27:01.606
Yes.

27:01.616 --> 27:02.996
Let's go.

27:06.526 --> 27:08.086
What exactly is she doing?

27:08.086 --> 27:10.326
I... I have no idea.

27:11.846 --> 27:12.686
Miss Si,

27:12.686 --> 27:14.506
I'm born to work. I can't rest.

27:14.526 --> 27:16.306
Those new chefs are strange to our kitchen.

27:16.326 --> 27:17.886
I'll give them a hand.

27:19.486 --> 27:20.326
The shrimps are dead.

27:20.326 --> 27:22.006
They're inedible.

27:22.486 --> 27:24.806
Miss Si, I meant to throw them away.

27:24.806 --> 27:25.766
There's fish for lunch.

27:25.766 --> 27:27.126
It's fresh.

27:27.566 --> 27:29.006
What are you waiting for? Help me!

27:29.006 --> 27:30.366
Go.

27:39.326 --> 27:41.206
Si seems more capable

27:41.206 --> 27:43.286
than I thought.

27:43.406 --> 27:45.446
We underestimated her.

27:45.486 --> 27:46.986
I know, right?

27:47.006 --> 27:48.066
In the past few days,

27:48.086 --> 27:50.386
when servants caused trouble on purpose,

27:50.406 --> 27:52.366
she wasn't mad at all

27:52.446 --> 27:53.486
but being so nice to them

27:53.486 --> 27:54.986
as to offer them

27:55.006 --> 27:56.226
paid vacation days.

27:56.246 --> 27:57.246
As for their work,

27:57.246 --> 27:58.326
she had found better ones

27:58.326 --> 28:00.526
from the outside to do it.

28:01.166 --> 28:02.546
A few boneheads

28:02.566 --> 28:03.766
did go home

28:03.766 --> 28:05.326
to rest happily.

28:06.846 --> 28:08.626
After a while,

28:08.646 --> 28:10.466
they'd lose their job for sure.

28:10.486 --> 28:11.666
That's right.

28:11.686 --> 28:13.006
The smart ones,

28:13.006 --> 28:14.566
who saw through Si's plot,

28:14.566 --> 28:16.746
wouldn't dare stir up trouble again.

28:16.766 --> 28:18.636
Let's see how long she can hold on.

28:32.806 --> 28:34.166
Qian.

28:35.446 --> 28:36.806
Qian?

28:38.086 --> 28:40.086
What's on your mind?

28:41.806 --> 28:43.166
Nothing.

28:44.406 --> 28:47.246
What were you saying, Mother?

28:51.246 --> 28:52.466
Qian,

28:52.486 --> 28:54.606
pull yourself together.

28:56.526 --> 28:58.026
A few days ago,

28:58.046 --> 29:00.666
I gave you a list from Matchmaker Wang.

29:00.686 --> 29:02.126
Did you see it?

29:03.766 --> 29:05.806
Is there anyone you like?

29:07.766 --> 29:09.926
It's only been a while since my divorce.

29:10.766 --> 29:13.846
Are you so eager to marry me off again?

29:14.006 --> 29:15.926
Am I such an eyesore to you?

29:18.246 --> 29:20.366
I didn't mean that.

29:20.566 --> 29:22.846
I'm concerned about you.

29:22.966 --> 29:25.006
Women grow old quickly.

29:25.006 --> 29:28.606
The sooner you marry, the better.

29:30.566 --> 29:32.886
"It's for your sake."

29:33.086 --> 29:34.606
Aunt Xiao

29:35.206 --> 29:37.566
has said so to you repeatedly, right?

29:46.766 --> 29:49.446
Don't try to sow discord between us.

29:50.846 --> 29:52.406
In this house,

29:52.646 --> 29:54.886
only Mother cares about me.

29:55.286 --> 29:57.046
I'm not sowing discord.

29:57.646 --> 29:59.086
Actually,

29:59.486 --> 30:01.246
I envy you a lot

30:02.086 --> 30:03.806
because your mother loves you

30:04.046 --> 30:06.246
and plans out everything for you.

30:07.246 --> 30:08.646
As you know,

30:10.006 --> 30:12.086
I lost my mother when I was born.

30:16.406 --> 30:17.926
What's your point?

30:18.246 --> 30:19.626
My point is

30:19.646 --> 30:21.026
parents' love,

30:21.046 --> 30:22.946
if misused,

30:22.966 --> 30:25.066
will hurt themselves and their children.

30:26.006 --> 30:27.306
I heard your mother

30:27.326 --> 30:28.406
started setting you up

30:28.406 --> 30:30.046
with others again.

30:31.486 --> 30:33.406
She was provoked by you.

30:34.006 --> 30:35.826
You have Mr. Zhen who's a rare catch,

30:35.846 --> 30:37.846
and you've taken away her power.

30:38.086 --> 30:39.646
She's mad.

30:39.806 --> 30:41.226
She has nothing to do

30:41.246 --> 30:43.086
but pay all her attention to me.

30:43.246 --> 30:44.986
Blaming me

30:45.006 --> 30:46.786
won't ruin my life

30:46.806 --> 30:48.846
or change your situation.

30:49.006 --> 30:51.266
At first, you listened to her

30:51.286 --> 30:54.086
to marry up for a better future.

30:54.246 --> 30:55.806
You saw what happened.

30:56.566 --> 30:58.366
Now, you have a second chance.

30:59.046 --> 31:01.246
Are you going to listen to her again?

31:02.766 --> 31:04.276
Flowers bloom and wither.

31:05.006 --> 31:06.566
People go up and down.

31:07.766 --> 31:09.286
I'm divorced.

31:10.686 --> 31:12.566
Do you think I still have a choice?

31:13.286 --> 31:14.466
Back then,

31:14.486 --> 31:16.366
we went to school together.

31:16.406 --> 31:17.926
We learned not to

31:18.166 --> 31:21.446
be pleased by gains or saddened by losses.

31:22.166 --> 31:23.666
Women aren't confined

31:23.686 --> 31:25.466
to their parents' or husbands' homes.

31:25.486 --> 31:27.186
Once you walk out,

31:27.206 --> 31:29.886
you'll see a completely different world.

31:35.646 --> 31:38.446
Why are you giving me that look?

31:39.006 --> 31:40.286
Is it really for my sake

31:40.286 --> 31:42.006
or yours?

31:42.566 --> 31:44.566
Did you go through

31:44.766 --> 31:46.886
that list from Matchmaker Wang?

31:48.766 --> 31:49.726
The 50-year-old

31:49.726 --> 31:52.056
Commandery Prince Nan'an
wants another wife.

31:52.136 --> 31:53.046
The owner of Yuxi House

31:53.046 --> 31:54.246
with a broken right leg

31:54.246 --> 31:56.006
has already lost three wives.

31:57.446 --> 31:59.686
Matchmaker Wang chose them for me?

32:00.486 --> 32:02.606
I know you're upset,

32:02.926 --> 32:04.286
but

32:05.006 --> 32:06.246
given your condition,

32:06.246 --> 32:08.286
we can't be picky.

32:10.766 --> 32:12.126
Yes.

32:12.966 --> 32:14.886
I can only be picked.

32:15.646 --> 32:17.526
Even my own mother thinks

32:18.486 --> 32:19.446
I can only marry

32:19.446 --> 32:21.086
some unwanted man like them.

32:21.326 --> 32:22.846
Qian,

32:23.206 --> 32:25.846
you're mistaking me.

32:26.206 --> 32:27.466
Alright. Never mind.

32:27.486 --> 32:29.326
It's fine if you don't like them.

32:30.166 --> 32:31.746
Lan's eldest daughter

32:31.766 --> 32:34.806
will hold a birthday banquet soon.

32:34.926 --> 32:36.606
You can

32:36.726 --> 32:38.326
dress yourself up

32:38.326 --> 32:39.986
and go there with me

32:40.006 --> 32:41.606
to meet others.

32:42.086 --> 32:43.446
Meet others

32:44.846 --> 32:46.906
to make them laugh at me?

32:46.926 --> 32:48.786
Cao Xingyu has just been put on death row.

32:48.806 --> 32:50.086
How could I spread my tail

32:50.086 --> 32:51.506
in public to find a new husband?

32:51.526 --> 32:53.606
How would people judge me?

32:55.286 --> 32:57.606
Si has taken over the household,

32:58.246 --> 32:59.766
so you're forcing me to remarry

32:59.766 --> 33:01.466
to bring down the First Branch?

33:01.486 --> 33:02.766
Am I your daughter

33:02.766 --> 33:04.326
or your tool to fight?

33:04.326 --> 33:05.466
Enough!

33:05.486 --> 33:07.746
What's wrong with you today?

33:07.766 --> 33:09.526
Would you rather grow old

33:09.526 --> 33:11.326
and die alone in this house?

33:14.286 --> 33:15.646
Finally,

33:17.206 --> 33:19.886
you've got it off your chest.

33:20.486 --> 33:22.446
As long as I'm home,

33:22.766 --> 33:24.646
you're ashamed of me, aren't you?

33:25.926 --> 33:27.286
If so,

33:28.006 --> 33:29.006
I'll leave.

33:29.006 --> 33:30.366
Where are you going?

33:32.686 --> 33:34.686
I've written to Brother and his wife.

33:35.246 --> 33:37.046
They aren't ashamed of me.

33:37.446 --> 33:39.406
I'm going to Lingxi tomorrow

33:39.766 --> 33:42.086
to get out of your sight!

33:42.166 --> 33:44.366
Qian, Qian!

33:44.446 --> 33:46.046
Come back!

33:48.246 --> 33:49.526
She's driving me crazy!

33:49.526 --> 33:51.386
She's so spoiled.

33:51.406 --> 33:52.846
I wanted the best for her,

33:52.846 --> 33:54.946
but she fell out with me

33:54.966 --> 33:56.826
and meant to live with her brother.

33:56.846 --> 33:58.186
I'm so pissed!

33:58.206 --> 33:59.126
- Ms. Xiao.
- I'm mad!

33:59.126 --> 34:01.286
Don't be upset. Have a seat.

34:06.166 --> 34:08.846
Ms. Qian said so on impulse.

34:09.206 --> 34:10.766
Actually, it's good for her

34:10.766 --> 34:11.766
to leave the city.

34:11.766 --> 34:13.286
How so?

34:15.126 --> 34:16.426
Think about it.

34:16.446 --> 34:17.606
Everyone in town knows

34:17.606 --> 34:20.046
what happened to her ex-husband's family.

34:20.286 --> 34:21.866
They may say hurtful things.

34:21.886 --> 34:22.966
If she goes to Lingxi,

34:22.966 --> 34:25.186
she'll feel better.

34:25.206 --> 34:26.326
Her brother can help her

34:26.326 --> 34:28.226
find a good husband there.

34:28.246 --> 34:30.626
On the bright side,

34:30.646 --> 34:32.286
it's not bad for her.

34:32.766 --> 34:34.486
You have a point.

34:35.726 --> 34:37.066
But Qian

34:37.086 --> 34:39.386
has never gone that far.

34:39.406 --> 34:40.746
Why does she suddenly

34:40.766 --> 34:42.806
want to go to her brother's place?

34:44.806 --> 34:47.046
Who gave her that idea?

34:47.886 --> 34:49.246
Ms. Ruan.

34:56.646 --> 34:57.746
Miss Si, why is

34:57.766 --> 35:00.066
the monthly allowance more than before?

35:00.086 --> 35:01.666
It's a little something from me.

35:01.686 --> 35:02.646
Don't worry.

35:02.646 --> 35:04.586
The extra money is from my own pocket.

35:04.606 --> 35:06.686
Aunt Xiao doesn't know.

35:09.686 --> 35:11.046
Well then,

35:11.126 --> 35:12.426
thanks, Miss Si.

35:12.446 --> 35:13.926
Don't mention it.

35:15.246 --> 35:16.246
By the way,

35:16.246 --> 35:17.606
I heard

35:17.606 --> 35:18.526
after Qian

35:18.526 --> 35:19.946
left for Lingxi,

35:19.966 --> 35:21.186
her mother

35:21.206 --> 35:23.846
was eager to marry Pei off.

35:24.566 --> 35:27.106
Although she's grounded,

35:27.126 --> 35:28.586
she interferes

35:28.606 --> 35:30.646
in others' business as usual.

35:31.246 --> 35:32.126
She can no longer

35:32.126 --> 35:33.386
rely on her daughter.

35:33.406 --> 35:34.686
Now, she's trying to

35:34.686 --> 35:36.306
manipulate someone else's.

35:36.326 --> 35:38.026
Isn't that good?

35:38.046 --> 35:39.686
Pei can't wait

35:39.686 --> 35:41.626
to marry into a good family.

35:41.646 --> 35:42.766
Ms. Xiao

35:42.766 --> 35:44.426
was picky.

35:44.446 --> 35:46.746
She meant to marry Qian up.

35:46.766 --> 35:47.746
Then what?

35:47.766 --> 35:50.726
We saw what happened to her.

35:53.086 --> 35:54.426
I might be a woman,

35:54.446 --> 35:56.046
but even I know

35:56.126 --> 35:57.036
if those of noble birth

35:57.036 --> 35:58.366
intend to marry humble girls

35:58.366 --> 35:59.826
from our family,

35:59.846 --> 36:01.966
there must be something wrong with them.

36:02.246 --> 36:03.326
Otherwise, who doesn't

36:03.326 --> 36:05.366
want to find a perfect match, right?

36:07.766 --> 36:10.646
I didn't mean you, of course.

36:10.926 --> 36:12.286
It's fine.

36:12.366 --> 36:14.306
I didn't know

36:14.326 --> 36:16.786
you were so sharp.

36:16.806 --> 36:18.846
I'm not sharp,

36:18.886 --> 36:20.686
but Pei's so gullible

36:20.686 --> 36:22.646
that she's led by the nose.

36:22.966 --> 36:24.326
Pei.

36:27.646 --> 36:29.006
Ms. Xiao.

36:36.926 --> 36:38.286
Pei.

36:38.406 --> 36:39.626
Mother.

36:39.646 --> 36:41.006
Ms. Ruan,

36:41.046 --> 36:42.746
I need to have a word with her.

36:42.766 --> 36:44.206
Give us some space.

36:52.766 --> 36:54.726
You never stop setting me off.

36:57.606 --> 36:58.966
Never mind.

36:59.406 --> 37:01.546
Your marriage is important.

37:01.566 --> 37:02.886
I won't blame you.

37:02.886 --> 37:04.486
My marriage?

37:04.966 --> 37:06.706
Didn't you tell your father

37:06.726 --> 37:08.686
you wanted to marry a civil official?

37:09.166 --> 37:11.226
In Ling'an,

37:11.246 --> 37:13.206
which one is the most honorable?

37:13.206 --> 37:14.346
It's Mr. Zhen.

37:14.366 --> 37:15.806
Mr. Zhen?

37:16.126 --> 37:17.146
Zhen Heng?

37:17.166 --> 37:18.526
Yes.

37:18.566 --> 37:19.746
I meant to

37:19.766 --> 37:21.766
set you up with him.

37:22.086 --> 37:23.566
Unexpectedly,

37:25.686 --> 37:27.186
Si beat me to it

37:27.206 --> 37:28.806
again.

37:30.086 --> 37:32.786
Ms. Ruan, I'll cut to the chase.

37:32.806 --> 37:35.066
There's someone I know

37:35.086 --> 37:37.746
who's perfect for Pei.

37:37.766 --> 37:38.686
I asked Mrs. Zhen

37:38.686 --> 37:41.146
to be the matchmaker.

37:41.166 --> 37:43.266
He and her son were classmates.

37:43.286 --> 37:44.866
He's from a decent family.

37:44.886 --> 37:47.226
Although he's only a local official,

37:47.246 --> 37:49.906
he's a wonderful man.

37:49.926 --> 37:51.046
He'll come to Ling'an

37:51.046 --> 37:52.426
to report on his work soon.

37:52.446 --> 37:53.706
Really?

37:53.726 --> 37:55.066
Yes.

37:55.086 --> 37:57.606
But as you know,

37:57.606 --> 38:00.586
Pei and I don't get along well.

38:00.606 --> 38:02.686
As her cousin, I'm in no position

38:02.686 --> 38:04.686
to interfere in her marriage.

38:04.686 --> 38:06.226
Don't worry.

38:06.246 --> 38:07.746
I'll tell her

38:07.766 --> 38:09.526
I found that man.

38:10.046 --> 38:10.926
Still, they should

38:10.926 --> 38:11.886
meet first and see

38:11.886 --> 38:13.476
if they like each other.

38:13.496 --> 38:15.416
Leave that to me.

38:15.436 --> 38:17.146
Thank you very much, Miss Si.

38:17.166 --> 38:18.506
You're welcome.

38:18.526 --> 38:19.946
I'm surprised

38:19.966 --> 38:22.486
you trust me so much.

38:24.286 --> 38:26.146
I don't trust you more than others,

38:26.166 --> 38:27.346
but I

38:27.366 --> 38:29.226
trust Ms. Xiao even less.

38:29.246 --> 38:31.686
She can't keep using Pei as her pawn.

38:32.326 --> 38:34.126
I appreciate your candidness.

38:34.206 --> 38:35.826
You may leave.

38:35.846 --> 38:37.886
Once he arrives,

38:37.886 --> 38:39.646
I'll let you know.

38:40.246 --> 38:41.966
Good day.

39:04.936 --> 39:05.826
Miss,

39:05.846 --> 39:07.646
why go to such great lengths

39:07.646 --> 39:09.406
to find a perfect match for Miss Pei?

39:09.406 --> 39:11.166
She treats you the worst.

39:11.166 --> 39:12.766
I hate her the most.

39:13.166 --> 39:15.546
Aunt Xiao must've figured out

39:15.566 --> 39:16.766
that Jiang Pei blurted out

39:16.766 --> 39:18.366
the Drunk at 8th Step.

39:18.686 --> 39:20.186
Once she comes out,

39:20.206 --> 39:22.006
she'll make

39:22.246 --> 39:23.966
Jiang Pei suffer.

39:24.286 --> 39:25.306
I see.

39:25.326 --> 39:26.806
That's why you have to

39:26.806 --> 39:28.766
find her a safe place to go soon.

39:29.286 --> 39:30.226
Aren't you smart?

39:30.246 --> 39:31.846
You got it right away.

39:36.486 --> 39:41.806
(Jiang)

39:42.366 --> 39:45.006
(Running the house is like cooking.)

39:45.286 --> 39:47.546
(Be patient and watch the fire.)

39:47.566 --> 39:49.406
(Don't rush it.)

39:49.926 --> 39:51.156
(A big fire is)

39:51.166 --> 39:53.306
(likely to overcook the food.)

39:53.326 --> 39:55.506
(Mishandling of domestic affairs)

39:55.526 --> 39:57.126
(can lead to trouble.)

39:58.246 --> 40:01.386
(A soft fire spoils the food
if left unwatched.)

40:01.406 --> 40:03.826
(Just like the trifles at home,
if left unsolved, )

40:03.846 --> 40:05.366
(will grow bigger.)

40:05.566 --> 40:07.546
(Only those with a big heart)

40:07.566 --> 40:10.726
(know how to balance things.)

40:11.686 --> 40:14.146
(Do the right thing at the right time.)

40:14.166 --> 40:17.226
(Keep a healthy routine and diet.)

40:17.246 --> 40:19.786
(Eat a light breakfast to help digest.)

40:19.806 --> 40:22.646
(Have a well-balanced lunch to gain energy.)

40:29.566 --> 40:32.226
(Things like social events require)

40:32.246 --> 40:35.186
(careful and proper planning even more.)

40:35.206 --> 40:37.886
(Farms and shops need management, too.)

40:37.886 --> 40:39.566
(Keep the accounts accurate.)

40:39.766 --> 40:42.646
(Make every cent count and be meticulous.)

40:44.206 --> 40:46.286
(The kitchen staff should know what to do.)

40:46.286 --> 40:47.826
(Have a clear division of work.)

40:47.846 --> 40:49.306
(Some prepare ingredients.)

40:49.326 --> 40:51.146
(Others cook them.)

40:51.166 --> 40:52.826
(Meals and fruit)

40:52.846 --> 40:54.346
(should be balanced)

40:54.366 --> 40:57.046
(to provide enough energy for the day.)

41:01.566 --> 41:02.786
(In that case, )

41:02.806 --> 41:04.526
(even someone captious like Uncle Anmou)

41:04.526 --> 41:06.246
(won't find anything wrong.)

41:06.966 --> 41:09.346
(As much as Aunt Xiao hates me, )

41:09.366 --> 41:11.076
(she has to play by our family rules.)

41:11.076 --> 41:12.286
Greetings, Miss Si.

41:12.286 --> 41:15.546
- (Servants should know their duties.)
- Miss Si.

41:15.566 --> 41:17.146
(Oversee their work constantly)

41:17.166 --> 41:21.026
- (to make sure they're responsible)
- Miss Si.

41:21.166 --> 41:23.946
(and everything at home is in order.)

41:23.966 --> 41:26.206
(Then our clan will thrive.)

41:36.686 --> 41:38.046
Greetings, Miss Si.

41:43.906 --> 41:44.756
Greetings, Miss Si.

41:44.766 --> 41:45.926
(Our clan)

41:45.926 --> 41:47.746
(will prosper)

41:47.766 --> 41:49.526
(and enjoy lasting fortune.)

42:05.246 --> 42:06.636
Anyone can come to the black market.

42:06.636 --> 42:08.716
His accomplices might be somewhere here.

42:10.446 --> 42:12.046
- Seize them.
- Yes.

42:21.886 --> 42:23.276
Run!

42:49.086 --> 42:53.406
(The End of Episode 10)

42:53.896 --> 42:55.626
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.626 --> 43:00.566
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.936 --> 43:03.316
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.316 --> 43:07.546
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.256 --> 43:10.656
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.676 --> 43:14.336
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.356 --> 43:17.776
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.926 --> 43:23.446
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.266 --> 43:27.946
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:27.946 --> 43:32.026
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.266 --> 43:34.006
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.026 --> 43:38.726
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.726 --> 43:42.296
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.316 --> 43:46.546
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.566 --> 43:48.346
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.346 --> 43:52.886
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.906 --> 43:57.706
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.936 --> 44:04.466
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.486 --> 44:08.106
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.126 --> 44:11.556
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.576 --> 44:16.196
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.196 --> 44:19.886
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.906 --> 44:23.996
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.106 --> 44:25.926
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.926 --> 44:30.476
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.496 --> 44:34.196
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.216 --> 44:38.376
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.556 --> 44:40.316
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.316 --> 44:44.836
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.836 --> 44:48.476
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.496 --> 44:54.166
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.856 --> 44:57.786
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.786 --> 45:05.286
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
